>
> Side note; I searched for "bidirectional" and didn't find anything in
> vlasisku.
> I then had a look for "graph";
> There is fancyxra meaning
> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Graph_of_a_function
> But I couldn't find anything for
> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Graph_(mathematics)
> Other graph related words ("edge", "vertex", "node", etc.) also seem to be
> missing.
>
> Did I fail to find the gismu for these concepts, or is Lojban lacking some
> basic, important, and useful mathematical concepts?
>

gismu are not meant to cover technical or specialized vocabulary, but you
could use "mokca" for "node", "terjo'e" for "edge" and "jonsu'a" for
"graph".

mu'o mi'e xorxes

